  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/21/gklc.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Valhelsia Structures 是一款生成新結構的模組，例如廢棄建築和地牢，一些原版結構也經過重新設計並被我們的版本取代。它還添加了不同的方塊，對於裝飾您的家園非常有用。Valhelsia Structures 與 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f;font-size:16px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valhelsia-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Valhelsia Furniture</a></span> 兼容建造。<br><strong>隨著更新，此模組將陸續加入新的結構、方塊、生物、頭目和功能。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/34/s7oh.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.valhelsia.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/documentation/gitbook_46h.png\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frdfQuaM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/discord-plural_46h.png\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/valhelsia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/23/52/aqeo.png\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fValhelsia%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/23/52/55ps.png\" height=\"20\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">加入我們的 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f;font-size:16px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frdfQuaM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a></span> 以獲取最新消息、更新日誌，並在遇到問題時獲得支援。我們還有極度活躍的聊天頻道和由社群成員提交的圖片庫。</span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fValhelsia%253fr%253dcurseforge%2bvalhelsia%2bstructures%2bmod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/23/45/g7d0.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"149\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f;font-size:16px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fValhelsia%253fr%253dcurseforge%2bvalhelsia%2b6%2bmodpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a></span> 提供快速、簡單且高品質的伺服器託管服務，擁有全球十多個地點可供選擇，確保低延遲。購買後，伺服器已配置完畢並可立即使用。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/35/cci7.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以下是一些您將能在世界中找到的結構。您還可以在截圖中看到與結構一起添加的新方塊，更多截圖可在 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valhelsia-structures/screenshots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">圖片庫</a></span> 中找到。<br><br><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/51/c18i.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"626\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/51/9kim.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"626\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/51/tyi7.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"626\"><br><br></span></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/35/l9nk.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">隨著更新發布，將陸續加入新功能，例如多種類型的結構變體以避免總是遇到相同的結構、新的結構、新的地牢、新的頭目和怪物。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/21/r6iz.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>查看我們的專案：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valhelsia-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/44/zywx.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"150\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/valhelsia-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/09/vt6c.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"150\"></a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/valhelsia-5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/44/2cpc.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"150\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/valhelsia-enhanced-vanilla\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://zupimages.net/up/22/09/gzpv.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"150\"></a></strong></p>",
